id: pm-jwmszf
title: "GH-943: health remediation points at validate while actionable unknown-author recovery remains undiscoverable"
description: "GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/943 reports that pm health emits a remediation_map route to pm validate --fix-hints for unknown-author events, but validate emits no actionable hint and the working history-author-acknowledge --all-actionable recovery is never named. Preserve one machine-executable remediation path across health, validate, contracts, CLI, and SDK."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
