author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "Unknown-author health diagnostics name an executable remediation that resolves the reported actionable set; validate --fix-hints either emits the same recovery or is no longer advertised for this warning; CLI, SDK, MCP, help, and contracts agree on the recovery path; regression tests cover actionable, legacy-only, empty, and partial-disposition cases; token-bounded output retains the remediation without private event data"
